                                "sense_id": "cf7cd66d-bf29-352d-9d8e-f72fec3bb602",
                                "text": "For Walker, the battle against patriarchal society and its multiple sins of sexism, racism, classism and homophobia (among others) needs the womanist spirit of defiance and irreverence, on the one hand, and the desire for social integration, on the other."
